### F16 — Motor de IA dos Especialistas

## =============================================
## AI Config por Especialista
## =============================================

### Obter config de IA do especialista
GET {{host}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/ai-config
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Salvar config de IA do especialista
POST {{host}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/ai-config
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

provider=openai&model=gpt-5.4-nano&temperature=0.7&max_tokens=1024&debounce_seconds=8

## =============================================
## Vinculacao Especialista <-> Produto
## =============================================

### Listar produtos vinculados ao especialista
GET {{host}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/products
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Vincular produto ao especialista
POST {{host}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/products
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

product_id={{product_id}}

### Desvincular produto do especialista
DELETE {{host}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/products/{{product_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

## =============================================
## Handoff (Assumir/Devolver conversa)
## =============================================

### Ver status do handoff
GET {{host}}/tenant/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/handoff/status
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Assumir conversa (humano)
POST {{host}}/tenant/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/handoff
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Devolver conversa para IA
POST {{host}}/tenant/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/handoff/release
Cookie: token={{token}}
